---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy · BCQStudios" description="How BCQStudios handles information on this site and in studio work.">
	<h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy.</h1>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		How Brendan Callanan trading as BCQStudios handles information on this site and in studio work.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Site</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		This site has no accounts, forms, or analytics, and we do not set cookies. Pages are public. The
		host may keep standard request logs, such as IP address and browser, to run the site.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Email</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		If you write to us, we keep the conversation so we can reply and do the work. We do not sell
		that.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Materials</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		What you send for an engagement is used to do that work. We keep it as long as the engagement
		needs, then as long as we must for records or law.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Rights</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		Under GDPR you can ask what we hold, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it, unless we
		must keep it. Irish law applies.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Contact</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		Write to <a
			href="mailto:questions@bcqstudios.com"
			class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline"
		>questions@bcqstudios.com</a>
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Changes</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		We may update these notes. The date below is the current version.
	</p>
	<p class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground/60">Last updated 17 September 2026</p>
	<p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
		<a href="/" class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline">
			Back to the studio
		</a>
	</p>
</Layout>
